  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ba398dc87565ae34685c80a74190cc0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Entry Level
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Tell me a little about yourself and what led you to this interview.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: What excites you most about starting your career?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: What is your biggest motivation?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: In your opinion, what is your greatest strength?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: What is your greatest weakness?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: What are your professional goals?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: How would you define success?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Tell me a little bit about your degree and time in college.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: What made you choose your university or college?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Describe your biggest challenge in school and how you overcame it.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: How do you stay organized when juggling multiple responsibilities?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: If you were given an unfamiliar task with no instructions, how would you
      move forward?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: How would you present a criticism, issue or suggestion to a supervisor?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Describe a time when you had to work with a particularly difficult individual.
      How did you manage the situation?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Tell me about a time when you were a part of a team. What was your role
      and how did it go?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Can you describe a time when you used problem-solving to achieve a goal?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Tell me about a time you received constructive feedback. How did you apply
      it?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: How do you ensure continuous self-motivation when tasks feel repetitive
      or difficult?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Can you provide an example of when you adapted quickly to a change in plans?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Describe an instance when you demonstrated ethical judgment in a group
      or work setting.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: How have you dealt with an ambiguous task when instructions were unclear?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Tell me about a time when you collaborated with people from different backgrounds
      or personalities.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Why are you interested in this role?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: What do you know about our company?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: How has your internship experience prepared you for this position?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: What classwork has best prepared you for this role?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: How would you assess your writing and communication skills?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Describe a time you handled a looming deadline successfully.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Tell me about a time you persuaded someone to see things your way.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  - text: Describe a successful presentation you gave and why it was a hit.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 1
  randomizeSentences: 1
  sentencesToUse: 2
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0ddbbf92e9f227b47b780accb7d3381b, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
